  "description": "EtlKit is a fully open-source (MIT) ETL library and data integration toolbox for .NET.\n      Build extract-transform-load pipelines programmatically in C# with async, in-memory\n      data flow components backed by TPL Dataflow.\n      Dynamic LINQ-based row filtration. Provides ExpressionRowFiltration that evaluates a\n      string predicate through System.Linq.Dynamic.Core. No Roslyn, no per-shape assembly\n      emission - lightweight compared to EtlKit.Scripting. Supports custom-type method calls\n      via RegisterCustomTypes, bulk type registration via AdditionalAssemblyNames, and short\n      type-name resolution via AdditionalImports for XML-defined flows.",
